# No em dashes or en dashes

Never use the em dash (`—`) or en dash (`–`) anywhere in this project: user-facing copy, metadata titles, aria labels, comments, or commit messages.

## Use instead

- Sentence breaks: comma, period, colon, or a spaced hyphen (` - `)
- Ranges and dates: a regular hyphen (`1-2 weeks`, `Mon-Fri`)
- Attribution: comma or spaced hyphen (`quote - Name`)

## Examples

- Bad: `The foundation of every project — how your brand looks`
- Good: `The foundation of every project - how your brand looks`
- Bad: `Process — From Brief to Launch`
- Good: `Process - From Brief to Launch`
